{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And molten elohim you shall not make for yourselves.</b> What is the point of ״for yourselves,״ seeing that for making for others there is already a warning? Rather, the Holy One, blessed be He, said: molten elohim you shall not make for others either, and what others make — you shall not accept as elohah."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:17.133006229Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}